<mxCell id="c41" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#444444;&quot;&gt;A pass asks Keycloak once per live session (10 s timeout each) and stops at a 50 s deadline&lt;br&gt;(IdentityWatch.DEADLINE): the gap between passes is at most 120 s. Bounds: 10-agent-security, page 6.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#aaaaaa;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=8;dashed=1;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="726" width="560" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
